DefundCallback_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when assets zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when assets non zero
   ├── when callback owned by another vault
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidCallback
   └── when callback owned by vault
      ├── given idToMarketParams returns zero loanToken
      │  └── it should revert with UnknownMarket
      └── given known market
         ├── given callback has not authorized adapter on Morpho
         │  └── it should revert in Morpho with not authorized
         └── given callback authorized adapter
            ├── given funding market removed from allowlist
            │  └── it should still withdraw to vault
            └── given funding market allowlisted
               ├── it should withdraw from the callback position
               ├── it should send assets to vault
               └── it should emit MidnightCallbackAction
